---
// TechnicalSpecs: Mission-critical architecture and SIFEN compliance
---

<section id="tecnica" class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-surface border-t border-outline-variant/15 transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & Specs -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/10 border border-brand-blue/20 text-brand-blue text-xs font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">terminal</span>
          Solidez de Grado Industrial
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-on-surface tracking-tight mb-6">
          Ingeniería de software que protege la continuidad de tu negocio
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-8">
          InteliMarket no depende de navegadores web frágiles que se congelan cuando el router parpadea. Implementamos arquitectura local-first con réplica en nube continua desarrollada por los ingenieros de <strong class="text-on-surface">IntelliHouse</strong>.
        </p>

        <!-- Technical checklist -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <div class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-brand-mint/15 text-brand-mint mt-0.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">electric_bolt</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline text-sm font-bold text-on-surface">SIFEN e-Kuatia Nativo (DNIT Paraguay)</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                Emisión de comprobantes electrónicos en menos de 0.05 segundos con código QR y generación directa de KuDE térmico sin intermediarios costosos.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <div class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-brand-blue/15 text-brand-blue mt-0.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">lan</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline text-sm font-bold text-on-surface">Arquitectura Híbrida Local + Cloud</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                Si se corta la fibra óptica o la electricidad comunitaria, las cajas siguen vendiendo de forma autónoma y sincronizan inmediatamente al reanudar la conexión.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <div class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-tertiary/15 text-tertiary mt-0.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">security</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline text-sm font-bold text-on-surface">Auditoría Estricta y Anti-Fraude</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                Cada anulación de ítem, apertura manual de gaveta, descuento especial o retiro de dinero queda registrado con hora exacta, cajero y supervisor autorizante.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Visual Tech Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-container p-6 sm:p-8 border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 mb-6 border-b border-outline-variant/20">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand-mint animate-pulse"></span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider">
                Cluster Health & Status
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-mint font-semibold bg-brand-mint/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
              99.99% Uptime Operativo
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest">
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant">Latencia de Cobro Local:</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-brand-mint">&lt; 12 ms</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest">
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant">Validación e-Kuatia SIFEN:</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-brand-mint">0.038 s (DNIT Aprobado)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest">
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant">Sincronización en Segundo Plano:</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-on-surface">Activa (Zero-Downtime)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest">
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant">Compatibilidad de Balanzas:</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-brand-blue">Toledo, Systel, Magellan, CAS</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-mint/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-mint">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">verified_user</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="text-xs font-headline font-bold text-on-surface block">Homologado en Paraguay</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Cumplimiento fiscal DNIT y Ley 6380/19</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
